"借助外部工具核对" = "Check with external tools";

"OCR 仅辅助抄录，请对照包装核对名称、含量与每份定义。" = "OCR helps transcribe the label. Check names, amounts and serving definitions against the package.";

"文字仅整理名称与明确份量，不估算营养。请按标签填写已知值；照片仅在本页辅助核对，不会识别或保存。" = "Text organizes names and explicit quantities only. Enter known nutrients from the label. Photos are temporary references on this page, not analyzed or saved.";

"已核对实际份量及填写的营养值" = "I have checked the actual quantities and entered nutrients";

"只填写有依据的营养值，未知留空。外部工具的回答也需要对照标签或资料核实。" = "Enter supported nutrient values only; leave unknowns blank. Check external answers against labels or reliable sources.";

"已整理名称与明确份量，请补充已知营养值；未知留空。" = "Names and explicit quantities are ready. Enter known nutrients; leave unknowns blank.";

"照片仅供本页核对，请手动填写食品、实际数量及已知营养值。" = "This photo is a temporary reference. Enter foods, actual quantities and known nutrients manually.";

"离线记录 · 无账号 · 无内置 AI" = "Offline recording · No account · No built-in AI";

"参考餐食照片并手动记录" = "Record manually with a meal photo";

"接收照片作为填写参考；请手动填写实际数量和已知营养值，确认后同步 Apple 健康。" = "Use a photo as a reference. Enter actual quantities and known nutrients, then confirm to sync with Apple Health.";

"快捷指令可将照片传给“参考餐食照片并手动记录”。照片仅供本页核对；手动填写实际数量与已知营养后确认，不会自动识别。" = "Pass a photo to “Record manually with a meal photo” in Shortcuts. It is a temporary reference. Enter quantities and known nutrients, then confirm; no automatic recognition runs.";

"请填写已知营养并核对实际份量，确认后才写入 Apple 健康。" = "Enter known nutrients and check actual quantities. Apple Health is updated only after confirmation.";

"请先确认实际摄入量及填写的营养值。" = "Please confirm actual quantities and entered nutrient values first.";

"可选的外部工具" = "Optional external tools";

"你可以自行使用 ChatGPT、Claude 或其他工具核对标签。OpenIntake 不连接这些服务，不需要账号或 API 密钥，也不会自动发送照片或健康记录。" = "You can use ChatGPT, Claude or another tool to check a label. OpenIntake does not connect to these services, require accounts or API keys, or automatically send photos or health records.";

"分享核对提示词" = "Share a checking prompt";

"这里只分享通用提示词；照片和文字由你自行选择是否提供给外部服务，并遵循其隐私政策。外部回答不保证准确。" = "Only a generic prompt is shared. You decide whether to provide photos or text to an external service under its privacy policy. Its answers may be inaccurate.";

"核对后手动填写" = "Check, then enter manually";

"1. 对照包装或可靠资料，核对每份／每100g／每100mL、含量与单位。\n2. 在产品或餐食页填入已核实的数值；未知留空。\n3. 保存产品供以后复用。实际摄入时输入数量，确认后才同步 Apple 健康。" = "1. Check the serving / per 100 g / per 100 mL basis, values and units against the package or a reliable source.\n2. Enter checked values on the product or meal page; leave unknowns blank.\n3. Save products for reuse. Record actual quantities after consumption and confirm to sync with Apple Health.";

"保存产品不会记录摄入。只有同步中心显示已写入并核验，才代表对应样本完成同步。" = "Saving a product does not record intake. Samples are synced only when the sync center reports that they were saved and verified.";

"请帮我整理我提供的包装标签，不猜测缺失营养值。列出产品名称、每份定义、各成分原名、含量、单位及原文依据；区分总量、子成分和提取物当量。未知请写未知。不要把推荐服用量当作实际摄入量，也不要把药物剂量当作营养。普通餐食若没有可靠营养资料，请不要编造数值，并注明来源与不确定性。我会核对后手动填入 OpenIntake。" = "Please organize the package label I provide without guessing missing nutrients. List the product name, serving definition, original ingredient names, amounts, units and source text. Distinguish totals, subcomponents and extract equivalents. Mark unknowns as unknown. Do not treat recommended doses as actual intake or medication doses as nutrients. For meals without reliable nutrition information, do not invent values. State sources and uncertainty. I will verify the information before manually entering it in OpenIntake.";

